This license covers the code in this repository only.

Third-party data and methods used but NOT redistributed here:

  ChEMBL 37 — EMBL-EBI, released under CC BY-SA 3.0. The pretraining corpus
  and ABL1 bioactivity set are derived from ChEMBL and downloaded at runtime;
  no ChEMBL data is committed to this repository.

  Protein structures — PDB entries 1IEP, 2GQG and 3CS9, and the AlphaFold DB
  model for UniProt P00519, are downloaded at runtime and not redistributed.

  Method — the RL approach reproduced here is due to Korshunova, Ginsburg,
  Tropsha and Isayev, Commun Chem 5:129 (2022).
